{"parse": {"title": "Limestone rock", "pageid": 29060, "revid": 15209145, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{external|rs=Limestone rock|dw=Limestone Rock}}\n{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Full\n|version2 = 2 Limestone\n|version3 = 1 Limestone\n|version4 = Depleted\n|name1 = Limestone rock\n|name2 = Limestone rock\n|name3 = Limestone rock\n|name4 = Pile of rock\n|image1 = [[File:Limestone rock.png|220px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Limestone rock (2 limestone).png|220px]]\n|image3 = [[File:Limestone rock (1 limestone).png|220px]]\n|image4 = [[File:Pile of rock (depleted).png|220px]]\n|release = [[20 September]] [[2004]]\n|update = Plague City Part 4 Released\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|location = Varies\n|options = Mine\n|examine1 = A pile of lime rock.\n|examine2 = A pile of lime rock.\n|examine3 = A pile of lime rock.\n|examine4 = A pile of rock formerly containing lime.\n|map = No\n|id1 = 11382\n|id2 = 11383\n|id3 = 11384\n|id4 = 11385\n}}\n'''Limestone rock''' is a rock from which [[limestone]] can be [[Mining|mined]]. Three can be mined from the rock before it is depleted. Limestone is used in several [[skill]]s: [[Mining]], [[Crafting]], and [[Construction]]. It also finds some use in several [[quests]].\n\n{{Colour|red|'''Warning:'''}} Attempting to [[Smithing|smelt]] the limestone without proper glove protection will inflict 8 points of damage.\n\n==Locations==\n{{ObjectTableHead}}\n{{ObjectLocLine\n|name = Limestone rock\n|location = [[Arandar mine]]\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = -1\n|x:2325,y:3271|x:2326,y:3271|x:2322,y:3270|x:2329,y:3270|x:2322,y:3268|x:2325,y:3268|x:2328,y:3267\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = tirannwn\n}}\n{{ObjectLocLine\n|name = Limestone rock\n|location = [[Limestone Mine|Silvarea mine]]\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = -1\n|x:3373,y:3502|x:3374,y:3502|x:3371,y:3501|x:3375,y:3500|x:3369,y:3499|x:3371,y:3499|x:3373,y:3499|x:3372,y:3497\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = misthalin\n}}\n{{ObjectTableBottom}}\n\n==Mining info==\n{{Mining info\n|name = Limestone rock\n|level = 10\n|xp = 26.5\n|tool = [[Pickaxe]]\n|time = 5.4 seconds if fully depleted<br/>11.4 seconds if two limestones depleted<br/>23.4 seconds if one limestone depleted\n}}\n\nLimestone rocks deplete by one stage and produce one [[limestone]] on every successful mining attempt, though more limestone can be gained using [[#Equipment|special equipment]].\n\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Limestone|quantity=1|rarity=Always|skill=Mining}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\nThe probability to succeed on a given mining attempt scales with Mining level according to the figure below.\n\n{{Skilling success chart|label=Limestone rock mining chance|showbefore=no\n|label1=Limestone|low1=95|high1=350|req1=10|color1=grey|image1=Limestone.png\n}}\n\n===Pre-roll===\n{{MiningPreGemDropTable}}\n\n===Tertiary===\nThe following items can drop together with the main resource. The rates shown are for a successful mining attempt.\n\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{SkillingTertiaryDropLines|skill=mining|baserate=741600|minlevel=10|maxlevel=99|varlamore=no}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Equipment==\n*{{plink|Varrock armour 1}}, 2, 3, and and 4 give a 10% chance to receive an extra limestone.\n*{{plink|Celestial ring}}s and [[Celestial signet|signets]] provide an invisible +4 boost to Mining level, regardless of charges. When charged with [[stardust]], they also give a 10% chance to receive an extra limestone.\n*{{plink|Prospector kit|pic=Prospector helmet}} boosts Mining experience by 2.5%.\n*{{plink|Amulet of glory|pic=Amulet of glory(4)}} increases the chance of obtaining gems when charged.\n*{{plink|Mining cape}}s give a 5% chance to receive an extra limestone.\n*Varrock armour, celestial rings, and Mining capes roll independently; multiple bonus resources can be given.\n*[[Mining gloves]] and all their variants have no effect.\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 15 March 2023\n|update = The Last of Poll 78\n|poll= New Skill: Community Consultation and Poll 78\n|change = * The objects have been renamed from \"Pile of Rock\" to \"Limestone rock\".\n* The depleted variant was renamed to \"Pile of rock\", and its examine text has been changed.\n* The \"Prospect\" option was removed.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Mining}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:23.032724+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Limestone\" title=\"Limestone\"><img alt=\"Limestone.png: Limestone rock drops Limestone with rarity Always in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Limestone.png?8cc7e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"30\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Limestone\" title=\"Limestone\">Limestone</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"1\" class=\"table-bg-blue\"><span>Always</span></td><td data-sort-value=\"263\" class=\"ge-column\" title=\"263 coins\" style=\"text-align:right;cursor:help\">263</td><td data-sort-value=\"6\" class=\"alch-column\" title=\"6 coins\" style=\"text-align:right;cursor:help\">6</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsort